{# Mira interview shows — "your episode is live" note to the guest
   (sent by pipelines/voices/publish_episode.py when wired to email;
   currently the Slack ping is the live notification). #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Your episode is out. It is Episode {{ episode_number }} of {{ show_name }}:</p>
  <p><a href="{{ episode_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ episode_url }}</a></p>
  <p>Thank you for the conversation. Share it anywhere you like, and if anything
  on the page needs correcting, reply to this email and I'll fix it the same
  day.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
